    "detailed_description": "An eternal classic of board games - a puzzle about collecting mosaics in realistic 3D. Ideal for those who want to relax and calmly collect pictures with pleasant music.<br />\r\nVisit an island of serenity in our raging world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n1. Intuitive mouse control, even a small child can handle it.<br />\r\n2. Selecting the number of details in the picture. From children's 4x3 to difficult 18x10.<br />\r\n3. A set of bright and varied images. Everyone will find something for themselves.<br />\r\n4. Low system requirements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game was created by one person. I will be glad if you play and enjoy. If possible, I will try to supplement the game with different features and content.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the plans:<br />\r\n1. Increase the maximum number of parts.<br />\r\n2. Add new interesting shapes of mosaics.<br />\r\n3. Add a new more difficult mode with the rotation of parts.<br />\r\n4. Replenish the collection of images with new selections.",
